/// \defgroup grp_gameclient Game client
/// \brief Drawables, FX, particles, input and the message stream: the
///        per-machine presentation side of the engine.
///
/// `GameClient` and its services: `Drawable` and the client modules, FX lists
/// and particle systems, the announcer, `InGameUI`, the display and camera,
/// string tables, movies, and the keyboard and mouse with the translators
/// that turn their input into commands. \ref sub_gameclient describes the
/// subsystem, its state and its differences from Zero Hour and BFME 1.
